# Phase 131: a pass whose window opens 5 s after arming, so the slew
# always lands late and the satellite is already well along. It must be
# chased and caught, not failed as "check the axis directions", which is
# a telescope fault and would stop a night plan.
name    Late pass: the slew lands after the window opens
timeout 420

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Late pass
wait   5
press  GOTO:PASSES
wait   5
arm-pass 5
expect 5   [SCENARIO] armed
press  GOTO:TRACK SELECTED PASS
expect 10  Satellite: slewing ahead, to meet it
expect 150 on target, recording.
absent 1   check the axis directions
shot   late-pass
press  GOTO:STOP TRACKING
wait   5
